## Dedupe recommendation

The accepted [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject/) and the
[triage instructions](/kb/triage/dedupe/) use normalized subjects. Keep that accepted
record intact. Replace its policy through a new decision: look up the tenant and
booking form, determine the cause, and merge only matching known causes. Leave
unknown tenants for investigation.

The explorer below demonstrates why identical subjects may belong to different
causes and different subjects may describe the same cause. It runs the same logic
used by the counts above.

